      "season": 0,
      "episode": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "released": "1992-02-18T00:00:01.000Z",
      "overview": "Twin Blood, is an alternate version of Blade and Evil's first battle, with drastically different character and mecha designs from the rest of the series, looking extremely more Techno-Organic. Differences include the absence of Pegas, with a drastically different transformation sequence, and a completely new Eyecatch.",
